sangati karma-karaka

  "karaka-amsha"
  "dvitiya-vibhakti-yukta phala-swarupa"
  -- object: what the action acts upon (the most desired by the agent)
  -- vibhakti: dvitiya (accusative)
  -- sangati root: phala (fruit/result) — object arises from action

shabda object / what-the-agent-most-seeks-to-affect-through-action

done
